    description: "FOUND 2026-10-03 while fixing WI-sofuh (branch jgstern-agent/fix/sofuh). The same mechanism WI-sofuh fixed for bare calls, callback arguments, object-literal values and shorthand properties -- an identifier resolved by NAME repo-wide instead of by the scope it appears in -- still runs at two js_ts sites the branch did not change (scope: measured what it shipped):\n\n1. `new Foo()` (`_extract_edges`, new_expression branch): `class_resolver.lookup(class_name)` over the name-keyed global class registry, no consult of the caller's own file or scopes. A file declaring `class Foo` and constructing it can bind to another file's `Foo`.\n2. The Express middleware chain (`app.post(p, auth, handler)`): `global_symbols.get(arg_name)` -- last-one-wins by name, no scope, no import, no same-file preference.\n\nFIX DIRECTION: route both through the branch's `_ScopeBinder` / `_resolve_value_ref` (a declaration in scope wins by position; a local value names nothing; only an unbound name reaches the name lookups). Measure by call site on a JS corpus repo as WI-sofuh did."  # f04b
    fields: {}  # f04b
